\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-2\">发布设置</h3><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"autoGenerateDigest\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-primary rounded border-white/20 bg-white/10 focus:ring-primary/50\" checked=\"\"/><div><label for=\"autoGenerateDigest\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200 cursor-pointer\">自动生成摘要</label><p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1\">插件会自动提取正文前120个字符作为摘要</p></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"isDefault\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-primary rounded border-white/20 bg-white/10 focus:ring-primary/50\"/><label for=\"isDefault\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200 cursor-pointer\">设为默认预设</label></div></div></div></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-2\">内容定制设置</h3><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"border border-white/10 rounded-xl bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-sm mt-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-3 border-b border-white/10 bg-white/5\"><label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300\">开头定制内容</label><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded-lg transition-colors bg-primary/20 text-blue-300 border border-primary/30\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-pen-line w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20h9\"></path><path d=\"M16.376 3.622a1 1 0 0 1 3